  "rationale": "Brunello knockout library in HEK293T-hACE2 cells, screen 1 (Grodzki et al. 2022). Column names follow the GSM titles (T0puro = Day 0; Cov-st = SARS-CoV-2 single infection at MOI 0.01; OC43-st = OC43 single infection). The authors ran MAGeCK on each infection vs the uninfected Day 0 replicates and read the enriched side (Additional files 6 and 8). Reinfection samples are not analyzed. Replicates are separate cultures, so no replicate term. OC43-st-1 to -3 are strongly bottlenecked (48-71% of guides at zero). The OC43 single-infected libraries collapse to few clones, so that analysis uses median-ratio totals and only its enrichment is read.",
